      "A priority mark does not mean a room is ready.",
      "Calling Eka repeatedly interrupts cleaning.",
      "The rule depends on people being available and remembering what a tick means."
    ],
    "gm_view": "The five-minute conversation sometimes helps. Another screen will not help if we still cannot spare five minutes or agree who may promise what."
